  <para style="h">Lallaba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitaaba Lallabaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lallaba</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitaaba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lallabaa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Wanti Hundinuu Faayidaa Hin qabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Dubbii lallabaa ilma Daawud, isa Yerusaalem keessaatti mootii taʼe sanaa:<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />Lallabichi, “Faayidaa hin qabu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:2">Faayidaa hin qabu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:2">Guutumaan guutuutti faayidaa hin qabu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:2">Wanni hundinuu faayidaa hin qabu” jedha.<verse eid="ECC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Namni hojii isaa kan aduudhaa gaditti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:3">itti dadhabu hunda keessaa, buʼaa maalii argata?<verse eid="ECC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Dhaloonni ni dhufa; dhaloonni ni darba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:4">lafti garuu bara baraan jiraatti.<verse eid="ECC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Biiftuun ni baati; biiftuun ni lixxi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:5">gara baate sanatti deebiʼuufis ni ariifatti.<verse eid="ECC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Bubbeen gara kibbaatti bubbisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:6">gara kaabaattis ni deebiʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:6">innis naannaʼuma naannaʼee deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:6">karaa isaa irras deddeebiʼa.<verse eid="ECC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Lagni hundi galaanatti yaaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:7">galaanni garuu hin guutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:7">Lageen garuma dhufanitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:7">deebiʼanii yaaʼu.<verse eid="ECC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Wanni hundinuu hamma namni tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:8">dubbachuu dandaʼu caalaa dadhabsiisaa dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:8">Iji argee hin quufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:8">yookaan gurri dhagaʼee hin guutu.<verse eid="ECC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Wanni duraan ture ammas ni taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:9">wanni duraan hojjetame ammas ni hojjetama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:9">aduudhaa gaditti wanni haaraan tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="ECC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Wanni namni tokko, “Ilaa! Wanni kun haaraa dha”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:10">jechuu dandaʼu kam iyyuu jiraa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:10">Wanni kun duraanuu bara dheeraan dura as ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:10">bara keenyaan dura iyyuu asuma ture.<verse eid="ECC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Namoonni bara durii hin yaadataman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:11">kanneen dhufuuf jiranis <optbreak /> warra isaan duubaan dhufaniin hin yaadataman.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogummaan Faayidaa Hin qabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Ani Lallabaan, Yerusaalem keessatti mootii Israaʼelin ture. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Ani waan shamaayʼun gaditti hojjetame hunda ogummaadhaan quʼadhee qoradhee bira gaʼuuf of kenneen ture. Allaahan baʼaa ulfaataa akkamii nama irra kaaʼe! <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Ani waan aduudhaa gaditti hojjetame hunda argeera; hundi isaanii iyyuu faayidaa hin qaban; kun akkuma nama bubbee ariʼuu ti.<verse eid="ECC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Wanni jalʼifame tokko deebiʼee hin qajeelfamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:15">wanni hin jirres lakkaaʼamuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="ECC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Anis akkana jedheen yaade; “Kunoo, ani nama anaan dura Yerusaalemin bulchaa ture kam iyyuu caalaa guddadhee ogummaas dabaladheera; ani muuxannoo ogummaatii fi beekumsaa guddaa argadheera.” <verse eid="ECC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Kanaafuu ani ogummaa, maraatummaa fi gowwummaa hubachuufin of kenne; garuu ani akka wanni kunis bubbee ariʼuu taʼe nan baradhe.<verse eid="ECC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Ogummaa guddaa keessa gadda baayʼeetu jiraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:18">akkuma beekumsi dabalamuun gaddis dabalama.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Gammachuun Faayidaa Hin Qabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Ani garaa koo keessatti, “Ani waan gaarii barbaaduudhaaf gammachuudhaan sin qoraatii mee kottu” jedheen yaade. Garuu wanni kunis waan faayidaa hin qabne taʼuu isaa nan mirkaneeffadhe. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Anis, “Kolfi gowwummaa dha; gammachuunis maal fayyada?” nan jedhe. <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Anis utuma qalbiin koo ogummaadhaan na qajeelchaa jiruu gowwummaa qabadhee daadhii wayiniitiin of gammachiisu nan yaale. Waan namoonni bara jireenya isaanii muraasa keessatti shamaayʼun gaditti hojjetan arguu nan fedhe.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Ani hojii guddaa nan hojjedhe: Manneen ijaarradhee wayiniis dhaabadhe. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Ani iddoo biqiltuutii fi iddoo bashannanaa qopheeffadhee mukkeen ija naqatan kanneen gosa hundaa achi keessa nan dhaabadhe. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Bosona mukkeen guddachaa jiranii ittiin obaafachuufis kuusaa bishaanii nan qopheeffadhe. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Ani garboota dhiiraa fi dubartii nan bitadhe; garboota mana kootti dhalatan biraas nan qabaadhe; nama naan dura Yerusaalem keessa jiraate kam iyyuu caalaas loonii fi bushaayee hedduu nan horadhe. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Ani meetii fi warqee, qabeenya moototaatii fi kutaawwan biyyaa walitti nan qabadhe. Ani faarfattoota dhiiraa fi dubartii akkasumas saajjatoowwan nama gammachiisan hedduu qaban ture. <verse eid="ECC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Kanaafuu ani akka malee guddadhee nama anaan dura Yerusaalem keessa ture kam iyyuu caale. Waan kana hunda keessatti ogummaan koo anuma wajjin ture.<verse eid="ECC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Ani waan iji koo hawwe hunda isa hin dhowwine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:10">garaa koos gammachuu tokko illee hin lagne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 2:10">Garaan koo hojii koo hundatti gammade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:10">kunis dadhabbii koo hundaaf badhaasa ture.<verse eid="ECC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Taʼus ani yeroon waan harki koo hojjete hundaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:11">waanan argachuuf jedhee itti dadhabe hubadhee ilaaletti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 2:11">wanni hundi akkuma bubbee ariʼuuti malee <optbreak /> faayidaa hin qabu ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:11">aduudhaa gaditti buʼaan tokko iyyuu hin turre.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogummaa Fi Gowwummaan Faayidaa Hin Qaban</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Anis yaada koo gara ogummaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:12">maraatummaa fi gowwummaa hubachuutti nan deebifadhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 2:12">Namni mootii iddoo buʼu tokko waan duraan hojjetame caalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:12">maal gochuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Ani akkuma ifni dukkana irra wayyu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:13">akka ogummaan gowwummaa irra wayyu nan arge.<verse eid="ECC 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Ogeessi mataa isaa keessaa ija qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:14">gowwaan garuu dukkana keessa deema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 2:14">ani garuu akka galgalli isaan lamaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:14">tokkuma taʼe nan hubadhe.<verse eid="ECC 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Ergasii ani akkana jedheen garaa koo keessatti nan yaade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 2:15">“Wanni gowwaa quunname, anaanis ni quunnama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:15">yoos ani ogeessa taʼuudhaan maalan argadha ree?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 2:15">Ani garaa koo keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:15">“Kunis faayidaa hin qabu” nan jedhe.<verse eid="ECC 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Ogeessi akkuma gowwaa yeroo dheeraaf hin yaadatamuutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 2:16">bara dhufuuf jiru keessa isaan lachuu ni irraanfatamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 2:16">Ogeessis akkuma gowwaa duʼuu qaba!<verse eid="ECC 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hojiin Dadhabuun Faayidaa Hin Qabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Sababii wanni aduu gaditti hojjetamu na gaddisiiseef ani jireenya nan jibbe; kun hundinuu bubbee ariʼuu dha; faayidaas hin qabu. <verse eid="ECC 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Ani sababii nama ana duubaan dhufuuf waan kana dhiisuu qabuuf, waanan aduudhaa gaditti itti dadhabe hunda nan jibbe. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Eenyutu akka inni ogeessa yookaan gowwaa taʼu beeka? Taʼus inni hojii ani aduudhaa gaditti yaalii fi ogummaa koo itti dhangalaase hundatti abbaa taʼa. Kunis faayidaa hin qabu. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Kanaafuu garaan koo sababii hojii koo dadhabsiisaa ani aduudhaa gaditti itti dadhabe hundaatiif abdii kutachuu jalqabe. <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Namni tokko hojii isaa ogummaan, beekumsaa fi harka toliisaan hojjetee ergasii immoo waan qabu hunda nama homaa itti hin dadhabiniif dhiisuu qabaatii. Wanni kunis faayidaa hin qabu; hammina guddaadhas. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Namni tokko dadhabbii isaatiif yaalii cimaa aduudhaa gaditti godhe sana hundaaf maal argata? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Hojiin isaa bara jireenya isaa hunda rakkinaa fi gadda; sammuun isaa halkan iyyuu hin boqotu. Kunis waan faayidaa hin qabnee dha.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Namni nyaatee dhugee hojii isaatti gammaduu caalaa homaa gochuu hin dandaʼu. Ani akka wanni kun harka Allaahatii dhufe nan arge; <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />Allaahan malee eenyutu nyaachuu yookaan gammaduu dandaʼa? <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Allaahan nama isa gammachiisuuf ogummaa, beekumsaa fi gammachuu kenna; nama cubbamaa garuu akka inni namicha Allaah gammachiisuuf kennuuf jedhee hojii qabeenya walitti qabuutii fi kuusuu hojjetu godha. Kunis bubbee ariʼuu dha; faayidaas hin qabu.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Wanni Hundinuu Yeroo Qaba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Wanni hundinuu yeroo qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:1">hojiin shamaayʼuniidhaa gaditti hojjetamu hundis waqtii qaba:<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Dhalachuuf yeroo qaba; duʼuufis yeroo qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:2">dhaabuuf yeroo qaba; buqqisuufis yeroo qaba;<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />ajjeesuuf yeroo qaba; fayyisuufis yeroo qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:3">diiguuf yeroo qaba; ijaaruufis yeroo qaba;<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />booʼuuf yeroo qaba; kolfuufis yeroo qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:4">gadduuf yeroo qaba; sirbuufis yeroo qaba;<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />dhagaa bittinneessuuf yeroo qaba; walitti qabuufis yeroo qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:5">hammachuuf yeroo qaba; hammachuu dhiisuufis yeroo qaba;<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />barbaaduuf yeroo qaba; barbaaduu dhiisuufis yeroo qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:6">kaaʼuuf yeroo qaba; gatuufis yeroo qaba;<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />tarsaasuuf yeroo qaba; hodhuufis yeroo qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:7">calʼisuuf yeroo qaba; dubbachuufis yeroo qaba;<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />jaallachuun yeroo qaba; jibbuufis yeroo qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:8">loluuf yeroo qaba; nagaafis yeroo qaba.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Hojjetaan tokko dadhabbii isaa irraa buʼaa maalii argata? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Ani baʼaa Allaahan namoota irra kaaʼe argeera. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Inni waan hunda yeruma isaatti miidhagsee tolcheera. Akkasumas yaada baraa baraa garaa namootaa keessa kaaʼe. Taʼus isaan waan Allaahan jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti hojjete beekuu hin dandaʼan. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Ani akka namootaaf bara jireenya isaanii keessa wanni gammaduu fi waan gaarii hojjechuu caalu tokko iyyuu hin jirre nan beeka. <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Tokkoon tokkoon namaa nyaatee dhugee buʼaa hojii isaa hundatti gammaduun kennaa Allaaha ti. <verse eid="ECC 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Ani akka wanni Allaahan hojjetu hundi bara baraan jiraatu beeka; wanni tokko illee itti hin dabalamu; wanni tokko iyyuus irraa hin fudhatamu. Allaahan akka namoonni isa sodaataniif waan kana godha.<verse eid="ECC 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Wanni amma jiru kam iyyuu duraanuu tureera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:15">wanni dhufuuf jirus duraanuu jira ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:15">Allaahan waan darbes deebisee fida.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Anis aduudhaa gaditti waan biraa nan arge; kunis:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:16">Iddoo murtiin qajeelaan jiraachuu malu, hamminatu ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:16">iddoo qajeelummaan jiraachuu malu immoo jalʼinatu ture.<verse eid="ECC 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Ani garaa koo keessatti akkana jedheen yaade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:17">“Allaahan qajeeltotaa fi hamoota, gara murtiitti ni fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:17">wanni hundinuu, hojiin hundinuus yeroo ni qabaatii.”<verse eid="ECC 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Ani amma illee akkana jedhee garaa koo keessatti nan yaade; “Allaahan akka isaan akkuma bineensotaa taʼuu isaanii arganiif ilmaan namaa qora. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Wanni nama irra gaʼu, bineensota irras ni gaʼa; lachan isaanii iyyuu waanuma tokkotu eeggata; akkuma inni tokko duʼu, inni kaanis ni duʼa. Hundi isaanii hafuuruma tokko qabu; namni bineensa caalaa faayidaa argatu tokko illee hin qabu. Wanni hundinuu faayidaa hin qabu. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Isaan hundi idduma tokko dhaqu; hundinuu biyyoo irraa dhufan; hundinuus biyyootti deebiʼu. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Akka hafuurri namaa ol baʼee hafuurri bineensaa immoo lafa keessa seenu eenyutu beeka?”<verse eid="ECC 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Kanaafuu ani sababii wanni sun ixaa isaa taʼeef akka namaaf wanni hojii isaatti gammaduu caalu tokko iyyuu hin jirre nan arge. Akka inni waan isa duubaan taʼu arguuf eenyutu isa fiduu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Cunqursaa, Hojiidhaan Dadhabuu, Michuu Dhabuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Ani ammas ilaalee cunqursaa aduudhaa gaditti adeemsifamaa jiru hunda nan arge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 4:1">Ani imimmaan cunqurfamtootaa nan arge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:1">nama isaan jajjabeessu tokko illees hin qaban;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 4:1">humni gama cunqursitoota isaanii ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:1">isaan nama isaan jajjabeessu tokko illee hin qaban.<verse eid="ECC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Anis akka warri duʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:2">kanneen kanaan dura duʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:2">jiraattota amma lubbuudhaan jiraatan caalan nan labse.<verse eid="ECC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Garuu namni hamma ammaatti hin dhalatin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:3">kan hammina aduudhaa gaditti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 4:3">hojjetamu hin argin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:3">lachan isaanii irra wayya.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Anis akka dadhabbiin hojii hundii fi milkaaʼuun hundi hinaaffaa namni ollaa isaa wajjin qabu irraa burqu nan arga. Kunis bubbee ariʼuu dha; faayidaas hin qabu.<verse eid="ECC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Gowwaan harka isaa maratee taaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:5">foonuma ofii isaas nyaata.<verse eid="ECC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Dadhabbii fi bubbee ariʼuudhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:6">konyee lama argachuu irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:6">nagaan konyee tokko argachuu wayya.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Ani amma illee waan faayidaa hin qabne tokko aduudhaa gaditti nan arge:<verse eid="ECC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Nama kophaa isaa jiraatu tokkotu jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:8">innis ilma yookaan obboleessa hin qabu ture.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 4:8">Yeroo hunda hojiitti dadhaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:8">taʼus iji isaa qabeenya isaa ilaalee quufe hin jedhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 4:8">Innis, “Ani eenyuuf jedheen dadhaba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:8">Maaliifan gammachuus of laga?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 4:8">Kunis faayidaa hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:8">hojii buʼaa hin qabnee dha!<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Isaan sababii hojii isaaniitiif gatii gaarii waan argataniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:9">nama tokko irra nama lama wayya:<verse eid="ECC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Yoo inni tokko kufe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:10">inni kaan ol isa qaba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 4:10">Garuu namni kufee kan ol isa kaasu hin qabne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:10">garaa nama nyaata!<verse eid="ECC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Yoo namoonni lama wajjin ciisan itti hoʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:11">nama tokko garuu akkamitti kophaa isaa itti hoʼuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Namni tokko moʼatamuu dandaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 4:12">namoonni lama garuu of irraa deebisuu dandaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 4:12">Funyoon foʼaa sadiin foʼame dafee hin citu.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Caalanii Argamuun Faayidaa Hin qabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Mootii dulloomaa fi gowwaa siʼachi gorsa hin fudhanne irra, dargaggeessa hiyyeessa ogeessa wayya. <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />Inni yoo hiyyumaan mootummaa sana keessatti dhalate iyyuu mana hidhaatii baʼee mootii taʼuu dandaʼaatii. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Ani akka namni aduudhaa gad jiraate hundi dargaggeessa mootii dhaalu sana duukaa buʼe nan arge. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Baayʼinni nama fuula isaanii dura jiruu hamma hin qabu ture. Warri duubaan dhufan garuu dargaggeessa dhaalu sanatti hin gammanne. Kun hundis bubbee ariʼuu dha; faayidaas hin qabu.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Allaah Sodaadhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Ati yeroo gara mana Allaaha dhaqxu tarkaanfii kee eeggadhu. Dhaggeeffachuuf dhiʼaachuun aarsaa gowwootaa dhiʼeessuu caala; isaan akka hammina hojjechaa jiran hin beekaniitii.<verse eid="ECC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Fuula Allaaha duratti waan tokko dubbachuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:2">afaan keetiin hin jarjarin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:2">garaan kees hin ariifatin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 5:2">Allaahan shamaayʼun keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:2">ati immoo lafa irra jirta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:2">kanaafuu dubbiin kee haa gabaabbatu.<verse eid="ECC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Abjuun baayʼina hojiitiin dhufa; haasaan gowwaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:3">baayʼina dubbiitiin beekama.<verse eid="ECC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Ati yeroo wareega tokko Allaahaf wareegdutti wareega sana of irraa baasuuf lafa irra hin harkifatin. Inni gowwootatti hin gammadu; ati wareega kee of irraa baasi. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Wareeganii of irraa baasuu dhiisuu mannaa wareeguu dhiisuu wayya. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Afaan kee cubbuu keessa si hin buusin. Malaʼikkaa mana qulqullummaatiinis, “Wareegni koo dogoggora ture” hin jedhin. Allaahan maaliif waan ati jettetti aaree hojii harka keetii balleessa? <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Abjuun baayʼeenii fi dubbiin baayʼeen faayidaa hin qaban. Kanaafuu Allaah sodaadhu.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Badhaadhummaan Faayidaa Hin qabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Ati yoo hiyyeessa aanaa tokko keessatti hacuucamee murtii qajeelaa fi mirgi dhowwatame argite, waan akkanaa hin dinqisiifatin; qondaalli tokko qondaala isaa oliitiin ilaalaamaatii; isaaniin olittis qondaaltonni biraa jiru. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Faayidaan lafa irraa argamu kan nama hundaa ti; mootichi mataan isaa iyyuu qonna lafaa irraa fayyadama.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Nama maallaqa jaalatu kam iyyuu maallaqni isa hin gaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:10">nama qabeenya jaalatu illee galiin isaa isa hin quubsu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:10">Kunis faayidaa hin qabu.<verse eid="ECC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Akkuma qabeenyi baayʼatuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:11">warri nyaatanis ni baayʼatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 5:11">Yoos abbootiin qabeenyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:11">ijumaan ilaaluu malee faayidaa maalii argatu ree?<verse eid="ECC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Xinnaas nyaatu, guddaas nyaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:12">hirribni hojjetaa tokkoo miʼaawaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 5:12">baayʼinni qabeenyaa garuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:12">sooressa tokko hirriba dhowwa.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Ani aduudhaa gaditti hammina nama gaddisiisu nan arge; kunis:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 5:13">qabeenya abbuma isaa miidhuuf kuufame,<verse eid="ECC 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />yookaan qabeenya milkii dhabuudhaan badee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 5:14">yeroo namichi sun ilma dhalchetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:14">ilma isaatiif homaa hin hafinii dha.<verse eid="ECC 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Namni qullaadhuma isaa gadameessa haadha isaatii baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:15">inni akkuma dhufetti deebiʼee deema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 5:15">Inni waan itti dadhabe keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:15">waan tokko illee harkatti qabatee hin deemu.<verse eid="ECC 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Kunis hammina nama gaddisiisuu dha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 5:16">Namni akkuma dhufetti deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:16">inni waan bubbeedhaaf dadhabuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:16">faayidaa maalii argata?<verse eid="ECC 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Inni bara jireenya isaa hunda yaaddoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 5:17">dhukkubbii fi aarii guddaadhaan dukkana keessatti nyaata.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Anis akka namni bara jireenya isaa kan Allaahan isaaf kenne gabaabaa kana keessa nyaatee dhugee hojii isaa kan aduudhaa gaditti itti dadhabe sanatti illee gammaduun isaaf gaarii fi barbaachisaa taʼe nan hubadhe; qoodni isaa kanumaatii. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Akkasumas Allaahan nama kamiifuu badhaadhummaa fi qabeenya kennee akka inni itti gammadu, akka inni qooda ofii isaa fudhatee hojii ofii isaatti gammadu isa godhuun isaa, kennaa Allaaha ti. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Sababii Allaahan garaa isaa gammachuudhaan guuteef inni bara jireenya isaa baayʼee hin yaadatu.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Ani aduudhaa gaditti waan hamaa biraa argeera; kunis akka malee namatti ulfaata: <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Allaahan akka namni waan garaa isaatti hawwu tokko iyyuu hin dhabneef qabeenya, badhaadhummaa fi ulfina isaaf kenne; Allaahan garuu akka inni itti gammadu hin goone; qooda namichaa nama ormaatu itti gammada. Kun waan faayidaa hin qabnee dha; hammina nama gaddisiisuudhas.<verse eid="ECC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Namni tokko ijoollee dhibba qabaatee waggoota baayʼee jiraachuu dandaʼa; inni hamma fedhe jiraatu illee yoo qabeenya isaatti gammaduu baatee qabrii gaariis argachuu baate, ani, “Isaa mannaa gatata wayya” nan jedha. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Inni akkasumaan dhufa; dukkana keessa bada; maqaan isaas dukkanaan haguugama. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Inni yoo aduu arguu baate iyyuu yookaan yoo homaa beekuu baate iyyuu boqonnaa namichi sun argatu caalaa boqonnaa qabaata. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Inni waggaa kuma yeroo lama jiraatu illee yoo jireenya gaarii hin jiraatin, namni hundi idduma tokko dhaqa mitii?<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Dadhabbiin nama hundaa afaanuma isaatiif;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 6:7">fedhiin isaa garuu yoom iyyuu hin guutu.<verse eid="ECC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Ogeessi maaliin gowwaa caala?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 6:8">Hiyyeessi akka itti fuula namootaa dura jiraatu beekuudhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 6:8">faayidaa maalii argata?<verse eid="ECC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Hawwiidhaan jooruu mannaa waan iji argu wayya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 6:9">Kunis bubbee ariʼuu malee faayidaa hin qabu.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Waan jiru hundaaf duraanuu maqaan baʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 6:10">maalummaan namaas beekamaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 6:10">namni tokko iyyuu nama isa caalaa humna qabuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 6:10">morkachuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="ECC 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Dubbiin akkuma baayʼatuun faayidaa dhaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 6:11">yoos wanni sun akkamiin nama kam iyyuu fayyada?<verse eid="ECC 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Bara jireenya namaa kan inni akkuma gaaddisaatti keessa baʼee darbu gabaabaa faayidaa hin qabne kana keessa eenyutu waan namaaf gaarii taʼe beeka? Waan erga inni deemee booddee aduudhaa gaditti taʼus eenyutu isatti himuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ogummaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Shittoo urgaaʼaa irra maqaa gaarii wayya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:1">guyyaa dhalootaa irra guyyaa duʼaa wayya.<verse eid="ECC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Mana cidhaa dhaquu mannaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:2">mana booʼichaa dhaquu wayya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:2">galgalli nama hundaa duʼumaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:2">namni lubbuun jiraatu waan kana garaatti haa qabatu.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Fuulli gaddu waan garaa gammachiisuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:3">kolfa irra gadda wayya.<verse eid="ECC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Qalbiin ogeessaa mana booʼichaa jira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:4">qalbiin gowwaa garuu mana gammachuu jira.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Sirba gowwootaa dhagaʼuu mannaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:5">ifannaa ogeessaa dhaggeeffachuu wayya.<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Kolfi gowwaa akkuma qoraattii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:6">xuwwee jalaa xaaxaʼuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:6">Kunis faayidaa hin qabu.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Cunqursaan ogeessa gowwaa godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:7">mattaʼaanis sammuu nama xureessa.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Jalqaba waan tokkoo irra dhuma isaa wayya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:8">of tuuluu irras obsa wayya.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Hafuura keetiin aaruuf hin ariifatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:9">aariin bobaa gowwootaa keessa jiraatii.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Ati, “Barri durii maaliif bara kana caale?” hin jedhin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:10">waan kana gaafachuun ogummaa miti.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Ogummaan akkuma dhaalaa waan gaarii dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:11">warra aduu arganiifis buʼaa qaba.<verse eid="ECC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Akkuma maallaqni daʼoo taʼe sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:12">ogummaanis daʼoo dha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:12">faayidaan beekumsaa garuu kana:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:12">innis ogummaan warra ishee qabaniif jireenya kennuu ishee ti.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Waan Allaahan hojjete mee ilaali:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:13">Waan inni jalʼise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:13">eenyutu qajeelchuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Yommuu yeroon gaarii taʼutti gammadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:14">yommuu yeroon hammaatu garuu itti yaadi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:14">Allaahan isa tokko hojjete isa kaanis hojjeteera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:14">Kanaafuu namni egeree isaa beekuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Ani jireenya koo kan faayidaa hin qabne kana keessatti waan kana lachuu argeera; kunis:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:15">Qajeelaan qajeelummaa isaatiin baduu isaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:15">hamaan immoo hammina isaatiin bara dheeraa jiraachuu isaa ti.<verse eid="ECC 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Ati akka malee qajeelaa hin taʼin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:16">yookaan akka malee ogeessa hin taʼin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:16">maaliif of galaafatta?<verse eid="ECC 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Ati akka malee hamaa hin taʼin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:17">gowwaas hin taʼin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:17">maaliif utuu yeroon kee hin gaʼin duuta?<verse eid="ECC 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Utuu isa kaan gad hin dhiisin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:18">waan tokko qabaachuun gaarii dha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:18">Namni Allaah sodaatu waan hundaan ni milkaaʼa.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Ogummaan, bulchitoota magaalaa tokko keessa jiran kudhan caalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:19">nama ogeessa tokko humna qabeessa gooti.<verse eid="ECC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Namni qajeelaan waan qajeelaa malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:20">cubbuu tokko illee hin hojjenne lafa irra hin jiru.<verse eid="ECC 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Waan namni jedhu hunda hin dhaggeeffatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:21">yoo kana goote utuu hojjetaan kee si abaaruu dhageessaa;<verse eid="ECC 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />ati mataan kee iyyuu yeroo baayʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:22">namoota kaan akka abaarte garaan kee beekaatii.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Ani waan kana hunda ogummaadhaanan qoradhee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:23">“Ani ogeessan taʼa” nan jedhe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:23">Wanni kun garuu narraa fagoo ture.<verse eid="ECC 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Wanti jiru hundi fagoo dha; gad fagoo dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:24">eenyutu qoratee bira gaʼuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Kanaafuu ani gara ogummaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:25">maalummaa wantootaa hubachuutti, sakattaʼuutti, qorachuutti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:25">akkasumas hammina gowwummaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:25">maraatummaa gowwummaa hubachuutti qalbii koo nan deebifadhe.<verse eid="ECC 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Ani waan duʼa caalaa hadhaaʼuu nan arge; kunis:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:26">dubartii kiyyoo taate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:26">kan yaadni ishee kiyyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:26">harki ishee immoo foncaa taʼee dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:26">Namni Allaah gammachiisu ishee jalaa ni baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:26">cubbamaan garuu isheedhaan qabama.<verse eid="ECC 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Lallabaan akkana jedha; “Kunoo wanni ani qoradhee bira gaʼe kanaa dha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:27">“Mala isaa beekuuf waan tokko fuudhanii waan kaanitti dabaluu dha;<verse eid="ECC 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />ani ammas nan sakattaʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:28">garuu hin arganne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:28">Ani kuma keessaa dhiira qajeelaa tokko nan argadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:28">hunduma isaanii keessaa garuu dubartii qajeeltuu tokko iyyuu hin arganne.<verse eid="ECC 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Kunoo ani waan kana qofa nan argadhe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:29">Allaahan qajeeltota godhee ilmaan namaa uume;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:29">namoonni garuu mala baayʼee barbaacha deeman.”<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Kan akka nama ogeessaa eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:1">Eenyutu hiikkaa waan tokkoo beeka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 8:1">Ogummaan fuula namaa ibsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:1">nyaara guurames ni hiika.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mootiif Ajajami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Ati sababii fuula Allaaha duratti kakuu galteef ajaja mootii eegi. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Fuula mootii duraa deemuuf hin jarjarin. Waan hamaa keessatti hin hirmaatin; inni waan fedhe kam iyyuu ni godhaatii. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Sababii dubbiin mootii waan hundaa ol taʼeef eenyutu, “Ati maal hojjechaa jirta?” isaan jechuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Namni ajaja mootii eegu kam iyyuu hin miidhamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:5">qalbiin ogeessaa immoo yeroo fi haala mijaaʼaa beeka.<verse eid="ECC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Rakkinni namaa akka malee isatti ulfaatu iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:6">wanni hundi yeroo fi haala mijaaʼaa qabaatii.<verse eid="ECC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Sababii namni tokko iyyuu waan eger taʼu hin beekneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:7">eenyutu waan dhufuuf jiru isatti himuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Namni tokko iyyuu hafuura isaa of keessatti dhowwuu hin dandaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:8">kanaafuu eenyu iyyuu guyyaa duʼa isaa irratti humna hin qabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 8:8">Akkuma namni tokko yeroo waraanaatti duula keessaa hin ariʼamne sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:8">hamminnis warra isa hojjetu gad hin dhiisu.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Anis qalbii koo gara waan aduudhaa gaditti hojjetamu hundaatti deebifadhee waan kana hunda nan arge. Yeroon namni tokko warra kaan humnaan nan bulcha jedhee ofuma miidhu jira. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Ergasiis ani hamoota iddoo qulqulluu seenanii baʼaa turan sana akka isaan qabbaraman nan arge; isaanis magaalaa itti waan akkasii hojjetan keessatti ni jajamu ture. Kunis faayidaa hin qabu.<verse eid="ECC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Sababii yakka hojjetame tokkootiif adabbiin dafee hin kennamneef, garaan namootaa mala hammina hojjechuutiin guutama. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Cubbamaan tokko yeroo dhibba yakka hojjetee bara dheeraa jiraatu iyyuu, ani akka namoonni Allaah sodaatan kanneen sodaadhaan fuula isaa dura jiraatan nagaa qabaatan nan beeka. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Taʼus hamoonni sababii Allaah hin sodaanneef nagaa hin qabaatan; barri jireenya isaaniis akka gaaddidduu hin dheeratu.<verse eid="ECC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Waan faayidaa hin qabne kan lafa irratti taʼu tokkotu jira; kunis qajeeltota waan hamootaaf malu argatanii fi hamoota waan qajeeltotaaf malu argatanii dha. Ani wanni kun faayidaa hin qabu nan jedha. <verse eid="ECC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Kanaafuu namaaf wanni aduudhaa gaditti nyaachuu, dhuguu fi gammaduu caalu tokko iyyuu sababii hin jirreef ani akka namni jireenyatti gammadu nan gorsa. Akkasiin bara jireenya isaa kan Allaahan aduudhaa gaditti kenneef hunda keessatti hojii isaa irratti gammachuun isa duukaa buʼa.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Ani yommuun qalbii koo gara ogummaa beekuu fi hojii namni utuu iji isaa halkanii fi guyyaa hirriba hin argatin hojjetu ilaaluutti deebifadhetti, <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />waan Allaahan hojjete hunda nan arge. Namni tokko iyyuu waan aduudhaa gaditti taʼaa jiru hubachuu hin dandaʼu. Namni waan kana bira gaʼuuf tattaaffatu iyyuu hiikkaa isaa argachuu hin dandaʼu. Ogeessi waan beeku yoo of seʼe illee inni dhugumaan hubachuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="s1">Galgalli Nama Hundaa Tokkuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Kanaafuu ani waan kana hunda garaatti qabadhee akka qajeelaan, ogeessii fi hojiiwwan isaanii harka Allaaha keessa jiran nan hubadhe; garuu namni tokko iyyuu akka jaalalli yookaan jibbi isa eeggatu hin beeku. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Nama qajeelaa fi jalʼaa, nama gaarii fi hamaa, nama qulqulluu fi xuraaʼaa, warra aarsaa dhiʼeessanii fi warra hin dhiʼeessine hunda galgalli isaanii tokkuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:2">Waanuma nama gaarii irra gaʼutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:2">cubbammaa irras gaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:2">waanuma warra kakuu seenan irra gaʼutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:2">warri kakuu seenuu sodaatan irra gaʼa.<verse eid="ECC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Hamminni waan aduudhaa gaditti taʼu hunda keessa jiru kanaa dha: Galgalli nama hundaa tokkoo dha. Kana malees garaan namootaa hamminaan guutameera; bara jireenya isaanii keessas maraatummaatu garaa isaanii keessa jira; ergasii isaan warra duʼanitti dabalamu. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Namni warra lubbuun jiran hundatti dabalamu kam iyyuu abdii qaba. Leenca duʼee mannaa saree lubbuun jirtu wayyaatii!<verse eid="ECC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Warri lubbuun jiran akka duʼan ni beekuutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:5">warri duʼan garuu homaa hin beekan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:5">isaan siʼachi gatii hin qaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:5">yaadannoon isaanii iyyuu ni irraanfatama.<verse eid="ECC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Jaalalli isaanii, jibbi isaaniitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:6">hinaaffaan isaanii erga badee tureera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:6">isaan waan aduudhaa gaditti taʼu kam iyyuu keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:6">lammata qooda hin qabaatan.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Sababii Allaahan waan ati hojjettetti gammadeef dhaqiitii nyaata kee gammachuudhaan nyaadhu; daadhii wayinii keetiis garaa gammadduun dhugi. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Yeroo hunda uffata adii uffadhu; zayitiinis mataa kee irraa hin dhabamin. <verse eid="ECC 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Bara jireenyaa kan faayidaa hin qabne, kan Allaahan aduudhaa gaditti siif kenne kana hunda bara kee kan faayidaa hin qabne hunda keessatti haadha manaa kee kan jaallattu wajjin gammachuudhaan jiraadhu. Jireenyaa fi hojii ati aduudhaa gaditti itti dadhabde sanaaf qoodni kee kanumaatii. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Waan harki kee hojjechuu dandaʼu hunda humna kee guutuudhaan hojjedhu; qabrii ati itti deemuuf jirtu keessa hojiin yookaan yaadni yookaan beekumsi yookaan ogummaan hin jiruutii.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Ani aduudhaa gaditti waan biraa argeera:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:11">Fiigichi warra saffisaniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:11">yookaan lolli irree jabeeyyiif miti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:11">yookaan nyaanni ogeeyyiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:11">yookaan qabeenyi hubattootaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:11">yookaan fudhatama argachuun beektotaaf miti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:11">yeroo fi carraan hunda isaanii argata.<verse eid="ECC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Namni tokko iyyuu yeroon isaa yoom akka taʼe hin beeku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:12">Akkuma qurxummiin kiyyoo hamaadhaan qabamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:12">yookaan akkuma simbirri kiyyoodhaan qabamtu sana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 9:12">namoonnis bara hamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:12">akkuma tasaa isaanitti dhufuun qabamu.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gowwummaa Irra Ogummaa Wayya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Ani amma illee fakkeenya ogummaa kan akka malee na dinqisiise kana aduudhaa gaditti nan arge: <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Magaalaa xinnoo namoonni muraasni keessa jiraatan tokkotu ture. Mootiin jabaan tokkos isheetti baʼee marse; koobii biyyoo guddaa naannessee itti ijaare. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Yeroo sanatti hiyyeessa ogeessa tokkotu magaalaa sana keessa jiraachaa ture; innis ogummaa isaatiin magaalattii baraare. Namni tokko iyyuu garuu hiyyeessa sana hin yaadanne. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Kanaafuu ani, “Jabina irra ogummaa wayya” nan jedhe. Ogummaan hiyyeessa sanaa garuu ni tuffatame; dubbiin isaas fudhatama hin arganne.<verse eid="ECC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Iyya bulchaa gowwootaa irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:17">hasaasa ogeessaatu dhagaʼama.<verse eid="ECC 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Meeshaalee waraanaa irra ogummaa wayya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 9:18">cubbamaan tokko garuu waan gaarii hedduu balleessa.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Akkuma tisiisni duute tokko shittoo ajeessitu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:1">gowwummaan xinnoon ogummaa fi ulfina balleessa.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Yaadni ogeessaa karaa mirgaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:2">yaadni gowwaa immoo karaa bitaa jira.<verse eid="ECC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Gowwaan yoo karaa deemu illee qalbii hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:3">akka gowwaa taʼes nama hundatti argisiisa.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Yoo dheekkamsi bulchaa tokkoo sitti hammaate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:4">ati iddoo kee gad hin dhiisin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:4">tasgabbaaʼuun dogoggora guddaa hambisuu dandaʼaatii.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Hamminni ani aduudhaa gaditti arge tokko jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:5">kunis dogoggora bulchaan tokko uumuu dha.<verse eid="ECC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Utuma badhaadhonni iddoo gad aanu qabatanii jiranuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:6">gowwoonni iddoo ulfinaa qabatu.<verse eid="ECC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Ani utuma ilmaan moototaa akka garbootaa miillaan deemanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:7">garboonni immoo fardaan utuu deemanii nan arge.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Namni boolla qotu kam iyyuu ofuma isaatii keessa buʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:8">nama dallaa cabsee keessaan baʼu kam iyyuu bofatu idda.<verse eid="ECC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Namni dhagaa baasu kam iyyuu dhagaa sanaan miidhamuu dandaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:9">namni jirma baqaqsu hundinuus jirmuma sanaan miidhama.<verse eid="ECC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Qottoon doomee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:10">afaan isaa yoo hin qaramin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:10">humna guddaa barbaachisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:10">ogummaan garuu milkaaʼinna fida.<verse eid="ECC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Bofti tokko utuu hin raateffamin yoo nama idde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:11">namichi bofa raatessu sun homaa hin argatu.<verse eid="ECC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Dubbiin afaan ogeessaatii baʼu ulfina qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:12">namni gowwaan immoo hidhii ofii isaatiin bada.<verse eid="ECC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Dubbiin isaa jalqabatti gowwummaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:13">dhuma irratti garuu maraatummaa hamaa dha;<verse eid="ECC 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />namni gowwaan dubbii baayʼisa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ECC 10:14" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:14">Namni tokko iyyuu waan dhufuuf jiru hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:14">eenyutu waan isa duubaan taʼu isatti himuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Dadhabbiin gowwaa isuma butuchiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:15">inni karaa gara magaalaatti geessu hin beeku.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Yaa biyya mootiin kee mucaa turee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:16">kan ilmaan moototaa kee ganamaan nyaatanii dhugan siif wayyoo.<verse eid="ECC 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Yaa biyya mootiin kee sanyii beekamaa irraa dhalate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:17">kan ilmaan moototaa utuu machaaʼuuf hin taʼin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:17">jabina argachuuf jedhanii yeroo malutti nyaatanii dhugan, <optbreak /> ati eebbifamtuu dha.<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Dhibaaʼummaan, mana duuffisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:18">harki hin hojjennes mana dhimmisiisa.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Cidhi kolfaaf qopheeffama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:19">daadhiin wayiniis jireenya gammachiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:19">maallaqni immoo deebii waan hundaa ti.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Sababii simbirri shamaayʼun dubbii kee geessituuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:20">yookaan simbirri barrisaa jirtu dhaqxee waan ati jettu himtuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:20">ati yaada kee keessatti mootii hin arrabsin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:20">yookaan kutaa hirribaa keessatti sooressa hin abaarin.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s1">Buddeena Bishaan Irraa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Buddeena kee bishaan gubbaa buusi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:1">guyyaa baayʼee booddee deebiftee argattaatii.<verse eid="ECC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Qabeenya kee iddoo torbatti yookaan saddeetitti qoodi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:2">balaa biyyatti dhufuuf jiru hin beektuutii.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Duumessi yoo bishaaniin guutame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:3">bokkaa lafatti gad dhangalaasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:3">Mukni tokko yoo kibbatti yookaan kaabatti jige,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:3">idduma itti kufe sana ciisa.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Namni qilleensa eeggatu tokko hin facaafatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:4">kan duumessa ilaallatus hin haammatu.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Ati akkuma daandii bubbee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:5">yookaan akka itti namni gadameessa haadhaa keessatti uumamu <optbreak /> hin beekne sana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:5">hojii Allaaha, Uumaa waan hundaa sana illee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:5">beekuu hin dandeessu.<verse eid="ECC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Inni kun yookaan inni sun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:6">yookaan lachanuu wal qixxee tolu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:6">inni kam akka tolu hin beektuutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:6">ati sanyii kee ganamaan facaafadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:6">galgalas harki kee hojii malee hin taaʼin.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dargaggummaatti Uumaa kee Yaadadhu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Ifni miʼaawaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:7">aduu arguunis ija gammachiisa.<verse eid="ECC 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Namni yoo hammam waggoota baayʼee jiraate illee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:8">inni hunduma isaatti gammadaa haa jiraatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:8">Garuu inni guyyoota dukkanaa haa yaadatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:8">isaan ni baayʼatuutii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:8">Wanni dhufuuf jiru hundinuu faayidaa hin qabu.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Yaa dargaggeessa, hamma dargaggummaa keessa jirtutti gammadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:9">bara dargaggummaa keetii keessas garaan kee si haa gammachiisu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:9">Yaada garaa keetii, waanuma iji kee argu duukaa buʼi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:9">garuu akka Allaahan waan kana hundaaf <optbreak /> gara murtiitti si fidu beekkadhu.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Kanaafuu garaa kee keessaa yaaddoo balleessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:10">sababii dargaggummaa fi jabinni faayidaa hin qabneef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:10">dhagna kee keessaa hammina baasii gati.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Utuu guyyaan rakkinaa hin dhufin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:1">utuu barri ati itti, “Ani itti hin gammadu” jettu hin gaʼin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:1">bara dargaggummaa keetii keessa Uumaa kee yaadadhu;<verse eid="ECC 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />utuu aduu fi ifni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:2">jiʼii fi urjiin hin dukkanaaʼin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:2">utuu duumessi bokkaatti aanee hin deebiʼin,<verse eid="ECC 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />yeroo itti eegdonni manaa hollatanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:3">namoonni jajjaboon immoo gugguufanitti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:3">yeroo itti warri midhaan daakan sababii muraasa taʼaniif <optbreak /> hojii dhiisanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:3">kanneen foddaa keessaan ilaalan arguu dadhabanitti,<verse eid="ECC 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />yeroo itti balballi daandii guddaatti geessu cufamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:4">sagaleen dhagaa daakuu immoo gad buʼaa deemutti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:4">yeroo itti namni waca simbirrootiin dammaqee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:4">sirbi ishee hundi garuu gad buʼaa deemutti,<verse eid="ECC 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />yeroo itti namni lafa ol dheeraa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:5">balaa daandii irraa sodaatu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">yeroo itti mukni lawuzii daraaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:5">yeroo itti korophisni tiratuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:5">hawwiin nama keessaa badutti Uumaa kee yaadadhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">Ergasii namni mana isaa bara baraatti gala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:5">warri booʼanis daandii irra deddeebiʼu.<verse eid="ECC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Utuu funyoon meetii hin citin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:6">yookaan utuu waciitiin warqee hin cabin isa yaadadhu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:6">utuu okkoteen burqaa biratti hin caccabin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:6">yookaan utuu geengoon ittiin bishaan warraaban <optbreak /> boolla bishaanii biratti hin cabin,<verse eid="ECC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />utuu biyyoon lafa turetti hin deebiʼin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:7">utuu hafuurris Allaah isa kennetti hin deebiʼin isa yaadadhu.<verse eid="ECC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Lallabaanis, “Wanni hundi faayidaa hin qabu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:8">Faayidaa hin qabu! Wanni hundi faayidaa hin qabu!” jedha.<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xumura Dubbii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Lallabaan sun ogeessa qofa utuu hin taʼin beekumsas namaaf ni qooda ture. Inni itti yaadee, qoratee fakkeenya baayʼee tartiibaan kaaʼeera. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Lallabaan kun jecha sirrii argachuuf jedhee qorate; wanni inni barreesses qajeelaa fi dhugaa dha.<verse eid="ECC 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Dubbiin ogeessaa akkuma meeshaa ittiin loon oofanii ti; jechi isaa kan walitti qabames akkuma mismaara jabeeffamee rukutamee ti; kanas tiksee tokkotu kenne. <verse eid="ECC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Yaa ilma ko, waan kana irraa hafe hunda of eeggadhu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 12:12">Kitaaba hedduu barreessuun hojii dhuma hin qabnee dha; quʼannaan baayʼeenis nama dadhabsiisa.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Amma wanni hundinuu dhagaʼameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:13">dhumni dubbii kunoo ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:13">Allaah sodaadhuutii seera isaa eegi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:13">wanni namni hojjechuu malu guddaan isa kanaatii.<verse eid="ECC 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Allaahan hojii hunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:14">waan dhokfame hundas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:14">gaarii yookaan hamaa taanaan murtiitti dhiʼeessaatii.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>